<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?> <?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="rss.xsl"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title><description>SONiC NOS（sonic-net/SONiC）の日本語非公式ドキュメント</description><link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link><atom:link href="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /> <docs>https://github.com/aoki-taquan/sonic-unofficial-docs</docs><language>ja</language> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:40:47 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:40:47 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.19.0</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link> </image> <item> <title>DHCPV4_RELAY テーブル</title> <description>DHCPV4_RELAY テーブル — DHCPv4 relay agent の VLAN 単位設定を保持する。DEVICE_METADATA.has_sonic_dhcpv4_relay = true のとき sonic-dhcpv4-relay (新実装) が読み出し、relay agent を構成する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dhcpv4-relay/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:29 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dhcpv4-relay/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/dhcpv4-relay.png" type="image/png" length="36792" /> </item> <item> <title>NTP_KEY テーブル</title> <description>NTP_KEY テーブル — NTP 認証 (symmetric key) で使用する鍵を CONFIG_DB に蓄積するテーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/ntp-key/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:29 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/ntp-key/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/ntp-key.png" type="image/png" length="24130" /> </item> <item> <title>AUTO_TECHSUPPORT テーブル</title> <description>AUTO_TECHSUPPORT テーブル — イベント駆動 (core dump 生成) で show techsupport を自動実行・古いダンプを掃除する機能の設定。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:19 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport.png" type="image/png" length="34292" /> </item> <item> <title>STATE_DB BGP 関連テーブル</title> <description>STATE_DB / BMP_STATE_DB の BGP 関連テーブル（BGP_STATE_TABLE・BGP_PEER_CONFIGURED_TABLE・BGP_NEIGHBOR_TABLE・BGP_RIB_IN_TABLE・BGP_RIB_OUT_TABLE）のスキーマ・フィールドデフォルト・書き込みタイミングを解説する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/state-bgp/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:19 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/state-bgp/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/state-bgp.png" type="image/png" length="32519" /> </item> <item> <title>SYSLOG_CONFIG_FEATURE テーブル</title> <description>SYSLOG_CONFIG_FEATURE テーブル — SYSLOG_CONFIG.GLOBAL の rate-limit を FEATURE (docker) ごとに上書きするテーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/syslog-config-feature/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:19 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/syslog-config-feature/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/syslog-config-feature.png" type="image/png" length="34832" /> </item> <item> <title>LLDP / LLDP_PORT テーブル</title> <description>LLDP / LLDP_PORT テーブル — LLDP テーブルはシステム全体の LLDP 設定 (GLOBAL キー) を、LLDP_PORT テーブルはポート単位の LLDP 有効化 / モードを保持する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/lldp/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:13 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/lldp/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/lldp.png" type="image/png" length="28056" /> </item> <item> <title>PBH_TABLE / PBH_RULE テーブル</title> <description>PBH_TABLE / PBH_RULE テーブル — Policy Based Hashing (PBH) は、packet match 条件ごとに ECMP / LAG hash profile を切り替えるための CONFIG_DB テーブル群。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/pbh/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:13 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/pbh/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/pbh.png" type="image/png" length="37767" /> </item> <item> <title>VLAN_INTERFACE テーブル</title> <description>VLAN_INTERFACE テーブル — VLAN を L3 IF (SVI) として扱う設定を保持する。VRF / VNET binding、IP アサイン、NAT zone、MPLS、IPv6 link-local、grat ARP / proxy ARP、loopback action、MAC を持つ。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/vlan-interface/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:13 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/vlan-interface/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/vlan-interface.png" type="image/png" length="34976" /> </item> <item> <title>APPL_DB ACL テーブル群</title> <description>APPL_DB の ACL_TABLE_TABLE / ACL_TABLE_TYPE_TABLE / ACL_RULE_TABLE — vnetorch・mclagsyncd・dashenifwdorch が直接書き込む APPL_DB 側 ACL エントリの構造・フィールドデフォルト・コード挙動。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-acl/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:08 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/appl-acl/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/appl-acl.png" type="image/png" length="31058" /> </item> <item> <title>COPP_GROUP テーブル</title> <description>COPP_GROUP テーブル — CPU 宛トラフィックをレート制限する Control Plane Policing (CoPP) のグループ定義。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/copp-group/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:08 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/copp-group/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/copp-group.png" type="image/png" length="29398" /> </item> <item> <title>EXP_TO_FC_MAP テーブル</title> <description>EXP_TO_FC_MAP テーブル — MPLS EXP ビット (0..7) を Forwarding Class へマップする CBF 用 ingress QoS 分類定義。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/exp-to-fc-map/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:08 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/exp-to-fc-map/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/exp-to-fc-map.png" type="image/png" length="35345" /> </item> <item> <title>MGMT_INTERFACE テーブル</title> <description>MGMT_INTERFACE テーブル — 帯域外管理 IF (eth0) に対する IP / gateway / forced routes を保持する。hostcfgd がこのテーブルから /etc/network/interfaces の mgmt- セクションを再生成する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/mgmt-interface/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:08 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/mgmt-interface/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/mgmt-interface.png" type="image/png" length="37664" /> </item> <item> <title>PFC_WD テーブル</title> <description>PFC_WD テーブル — PFC Watchdog の設定テーブル。port ごとに detection_time / restoration_time / action を持ち、PFC pause storm を検出して指定アクションを取る。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/pfc-wd/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:08 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/pfc-wd/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/pfc-wd.png" type="image/png" length="30464" /> </item> <item> <title>ACL_RULE テーブル</title> <description>ACL_RULE テーブル — ACL_TABLE 内の個別ルールを定義する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/acl-rule/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:03 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/acl-rule/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/acl-rule.png" type="image/png" length="20016" /> </item> <item> <title>CHASSIS_MODULE テーブル</title> <description>CHASSIS_MODULE テーブル — モジュラーチャシスおよび SmartSwitch における各モジュール（ラインカード・ファブリックカード・DPU）の管理状態を CONFIG_DB に保持するテーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/chassis-module/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:03 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/chassis-module/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/chassis-module.png" type="image/png" length="34020" /> </item> <item> <title>CONSOLE_PORT / CONSOLE_SWITCH テーブル</title> <description>CONSOLE_PORT / CONSOLE_SWITCH テーブル — SONiC を console switch として動かすときの、シリアル/コンソールポートの設定テーブル群。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/console-port/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:03 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/console-port/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/console-port.png" type="image/png" length="42198" /> </item> <item> <title>DPU / ENI / VDPU / REMOTE_DPU テーブル</title> <description>CONFIG_DB の DPU・ENI・VDPU・REMOTE_DPU テーブル — SmartSwitch の DPU (Data Processing Unit) と ENI (Elastic Network Interface) の転送情報を定義し、DashEniFwdOrch が ACL ルールへ変換する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dpu-eni/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:03 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dpu-eni/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/dpu-eni.png" type="image/png" length="43054" /> </item> <item> <title>MACSEC_PROFILE テーブル</title> <description>MACSEC_PROFILE テーブル — IEEE 802.1AE MACsec のセキュリティプロファイルを定義するテーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/macsec-profile/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:03 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/macsec-profile/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/macsec-profile.png" type="image/png" length="30748" /> </item> <item> <title>NEXTHOP_GROUP_TABLE / CLASS_BASED_NEXT_HOP_GROUP_TABLE</title> <description>APPL_DB NEXTHOP_GROUP_TABLE および CLASS_BASED_NEXT_HOP_GROUP_TABLE — fpmsyncd が FRR から受け取った次ホップグループを APPL_DB に書き込み、orchagent の NhgOrch / CbfNhgOrch が SAI 経由で ASIC に反映する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/nhg-table/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:03 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/nhg-table/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/nhg-table.png" type="image/png" length="34969" /> </item> <item> <title>RouteOrch event / notification (ResponsePublisher + NextHopObserver)</title> <description>orchagent RouteOrch が送出する 2 種類の通知機構—APPL_STATE_DB 書き込み + RESPONSE_CHANNEL（ResponsePublisher 経由）と内部 NextHopObserver—のフィールドとコード由来デフォルトを詳解する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/route-orch-event/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 00:37:03 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/route-orch-event/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/route-orch-event.png" type="image/png" length="42707" /> </item> </channel> </rss>